@model PagerModel
@* Phân trang dùng chung: <partial name="_Pager" model="PagerModel.From(Model.Data, new { Keyword = Model.Keyword })" /> *@
@if (Model.TotalPages > 1)
{
    var from = Math.Max(1, Model.Page - 2);
    var to = Math.Min(Model.TotalPages, Model.Page + 2);
    <nav aria-label="Phân trang" class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="small text-secondary">Tổng @Model.TotalCount mục</span>
        <ul class="pagination pagination-sm mb-0">
            <li class="page-item @(Model.Page <= 1 ? "disabled" : "")">
                <a class="page-link" asp-all-route-data="Model.RouteValues!" asp-route-p="@(Model.Page - 1)">‹</a>
            </li>
            @for (var i = from; i <= to; i++)
            {
                <li class="page-item @(i == Model.Page ? "active" : "")">
                    <a class="page-link" asp-all-route-data="Model.RouteValues!" asp-route-p="@i">@i</a>
                </li>
            }
            <li class="page-item @(Model.Page >= Model.TotalPages ? "disabled" : "")">
                <a class="page-link" asp-all-route-data="Model.RouteValues!" asp-route-p="@(Model.Page + 1)">›</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>
}
else if (Model.TotalCount > 0)
{
    <div class="small text-secondary">Tổng @Model.TotalCount mục</div>
}
